      <transcript>CØMYLE-</transcript>
      <definition>[=cømele-] v.t. To make dents or holes; to demolish.</definition>
      <page>203</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠡᠷ ᠴᠥᠮᠥᠯᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
